This workspace is **Briefly Frontend** only.

## Structure
- Web prototype: `web/` (React + Vite + Framer Motion)
- Mobile app: `mobile/` (Expo + React Native)
- Shared tokens: `packages/tokens/` (`@briefly/tokens`) — **single source of truth for brand colors**
- Web design tokens: `web/src/tokens.ts` (spacing, typography, motion; imports colors from `@briefly/tokens`)
- Runtime CSS variables: `web/src/index.css` (mirrors `@briefly/tokens` theme values)
- Design canvases: `canvases/`

## Design — Palette B (canonical)

**Light theme**
- Page bg: `hsl(40 20% 97%)`, surface: `#FFFFFF`
- Primary brand / CTA: `#C9184A`, hover: `#A01039`
- Text: `#1F1818`, secondary: `#4B3C3C`, muted: `#A99898`

**Dark theme**
- Page bg: `hsl(20 6% 7%)`, surface: `#221917`
- Primary brand / CTA: `#FF6B8E`, hover: `#FFA3BB`
- Text: `#FAF8F8`, secondary: `#E3DBDB`, muted: `#705453`

**Feed / player zone:** `#18110F` background, player surface `#221917`

- Fonts: Fraunces (display), Geist (body) — never Inter or Roboto as primary
- All colors from `@briefly/tokens` or CSS variables derived from them — no hardcoded brand hex in components

## Visual treatment restrictions

**Allowed:** pill shapes (tab bar, chips, badges), radius up to 16px on cards, 999px on pills

**Not allowed:** gradient fills, glassmorphism (`backdrop-filter` / blur overlays), gradient text, purple decorative gradients

## Motion
- Easing: cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1)
- Animate transform and opacity only — never width/height/top/left
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion

## Scope
- Default to `web/` unless the user explicitly asks for mobile
- Do not modify agent-tools/, mcps/, or terminals/
